{
  "title": "Iliac Crest Contusion (Hip Pointer)",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/knee-and-sports/3090/iliac-crest-contusion-hip-pointer",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 1 2021",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "An illiac crest contusion (hip pointer) is a traumatic hematoma overlying the iliac wing that occurs due to direct trauma or crushing injury, most commonly during contact sports.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made clinically with tenderness over the iliac crest with extensive contusion and hematoma near iliac crest.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is nonoperative with NSAIDs, rest and stretching.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathoanatomy",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**hematoma** occurs into area surrounding iliac wing",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "and can cause bleeding into hip abductor muscles",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "rule out **avulsion of the iliac apophysis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "in adolescent patients",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Anatomy",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Iliac crest is **origin of several muscles** any of which can be involved",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "sartorius",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "tensor fascia lata",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "gluteus medius",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "abdominal muscles",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "transverse or oblique muscles",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Symptoms",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "pain near iliac crest",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
